  "description": "Transform Your Commute with the Bull Urban Cruiser\n\nThe Bull Urban Cruiser is more than just a trike—it's a gateway to adventure and family bonding. Whether you're running errands or exploring scenic paths, this electric trike enhances your life with a fun, safe, and eco-friendly ride. Imagine pedaling through the park, kids riding comfortably behind you, and feeling the breeze as you go! With its ultra-low frame design, it's easy for anyone, including seniors, to hop on and off effortlessly.\n\nKey features of the Bull Urban Cruiser include:\n\nAccommodates up to three children with a rear bench capacity of 130 lbs.\n\nIntegrated headlight and rear brake light for added safety during nighttime rides.\n\nThe differential drive system ensures smooth handling on uneven terrains.\n\nGenerous under-bench storage for snacks and gear, keeping your adventures hassle-free.\n\nUp to 100 miles of range—perfect for those longer excursions with the family.\n\nPlus, with a powerful 500W motor and a 7-speed transmission, your rides will be both exciting and smooth. The Bull Urban Cruiser not only meets your mobility needs but elevates your outdoor experiences. Get ready to ride in style and comfort!",
